OL,3,GNEWSAStar plans sandwich date with
OL,4,A'friend' Paddington
OL,5,
OL,6,FHugh Bonneville said he will
OL,7,F"definitely" spend some time chatting
OL,8,Fand enjoying a marmalade sandwich with
OL,9,Fhis furry friend Paddington Bear when
OL,10,Fhe visits Suffolk.
OL,12,FThe British actor, who has starred in
OL,13,Fthree live-action films with the
OL,14,Fbeloved character, will meet up with
OL,15,Fhis old pal when he promotes his
OL,16,Fchildren's book in Bury St Edmunds.
OL,18,FThe 62-year-old will be talking at the
OL,19,FBury St Edmunds Literature Festival in
OL,20,Fthe town, which boasts a statue of
OL,21,FPaddington on a bench in the arc
OL,22,FShopping Centre.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
