OL,3,GNEWSAStar plans sandwich date with
OL,4,A'friend' Paddington
OL,5,
OL,6,FBonneville, who was born in Paddington,
OL,7,FLondon, said the county was "very
OL,8,Flucky" to have the Peruvian native to
OL,9,Flend an ear to tired shoppers when they
OL,10,Fneed a sit down.
